/target
**/*.rs.bk
.env
scripts/__pycache__/

# Scratch: working files, scrape output and logs. Kept on disk, never in the
# repository — the one thing under it that a BUILD needs (the recall test key)
# lives beside its test at crates/tools/tests/data/answer-key.tsv.
scratch/

# **The local rano override, and it must never be committed.** `rano` is a git
# dependency pinned to a tag so the tree builds from a clone; this file points it
# back at the operator's own checkout so editing rano takes effect immediately.
# An absolute path in a committed file is exactly what made the daemon
# unbuildable on a runner, which is the defect this arrangement exists to fix.
/.cargo/config.toml
